Scope of this license

This license covers only the code written for this project: the TypeScript
and three.js re-implementation in web/, the Python and Java tools in tools/,
the track minimaps rendered by those tools, and the notes.

It does NOT cover Racing Simulation 3 itself. The game's executables, data
archives, track and car models, textures, sounds, setups, names, logos and
any other original assets are the property of their respective owners
(Ubisoft and its licensors). None of them are included in this repository,
and nothing here grants any right to them. You need your own copy of the
game to run this project. This is a fan re-implementation with no
affiliation to or endorsement by Ubisoft.
